 "notes": "The site serves two institutions, the ESPA school and the ESPA kindergarten/nursery (separate addresses). I left out the kindergarten PDF (formulyar-taksi-za-uchabnata-dg-2026-2027.pdf), which covers 'Детски групи 1-4 годишни': €7550 one payment, €3930 per term, €2000 x4 instalments, plus food and piano. The school PDF's quotes were reconstructed from WebFetch output, which would not reproduce the PDF verbatim, so wording may differ slightly; the amounts are as WebFetch gave them. The column labels (I/II срок; I-IV вноска with dates) come from the PDF. The four instalments have no stated frequency, so their period is null. The sports/music block was garbled in extraction. The €330/€240/€300 per-term lines could not be tied to named activities (tennis, swimming, teams etc. are listed without clear prices). The €396 course has several grade-range lines (2-5, 4-5, 4-6, 3-5 кл.); I listed it once. Transport 'от спирка' has no amount. Camps (green/blue school, ski) are priced before each camp. I filed the guarantee deposit (гаранционна вноска) as registration, per the rules. The €300 admission-procedure fee is on the admissions page, with no year stated. ADJ: Re-fetch shows the PDF has a two-column layout, with activity names on the left and prices on the right. Matching by order and by identical grade ranges (2-5/4-5/4-6/3-5 кл.) ties each €396, €720, €330, €240 and €300 line to a named activity, so f25-f38 were rebuilt as one fee per activity (marked changed). The sports alignment relies on order alone (tennis 1-7, swimming ПГ, swimming 1-7). The €12/€18 per-hour rates sit after the piano line, but the left-hand names also include 'Индивидуални часове по основните учебни дисциплини'. Either way they are optional paid extras. Kindergarten PDF (sibling institution) excluded. The €300 admission fee was confirmed on the admissions page."
